  "question": {
    "text": "The number of triplets <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi></math>&nbsp;are distinct non negative integers satisfying <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math>, is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>80</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>136</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
